nscious decision to become Fin's best reference customer by redesigning our support model entirely around AI.\"\n\nThat's @decivory, our VP of Customer Support. And we did exactly that.\n\nBefore any other business deployed Fin, our own team did. We went all in: new roles, new workflows, new standards. The results?\n\nSupport didn't shrink. It got better:\n\n- 83% of support volume fully automated\n- 300% more demand absorbed as we've grown, without breaking\n- 2x increase in feature adoption and expansion revenue from proactive engagement\n- Every conversation that reaches a human is now genuinely complex, cross-functional, and technically demanding\n\nThe question isn't whether AI can transform your support, it's whether you're ready to go all in. Read the full story linked below, and see what that looks like.",entity_set:$R[1157]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg=:entity_set":$R[1158]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[1159]={__refs:$R[1160]=[]},symbols:$R[1161]={__refs:$R[1162]=[]},smarttags:$R[1163]={__refs:$R[1164]=[]},urls:$R[1165]={__refs:$R[1166]=[]},user_mentions:$R[1167]={__refs:$R[1168]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg=:entity_set:user_mentions:0"]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg=:entity_set:user_mentions:0":$R[1169]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTc1NDg0NzQzNTUyMTIyODg=:entity_set:user_mentions:0",__typename:"ApiMentionEntity",indices:$R[1170]=[132,141],is_unmentioned:null,screen_name:"decivory"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzU0ODQ3NDQ4NTIwMzA0Mg==:grok_translated_post_with_availability":$R[1171]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzU0ODQ3NDQ4NTIwMzA0Mg==:grok_translated_post_with_availability",__typename:"ApiGrokTranslateResponse",is_available:!1,data:null},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzU0ODQ3NDQ4NTIwMzA0Mg==:edit_control":$R[1172]={__id:"client:VHdl