The gap between those two things is larger than it looks; and right now, it's where the most consequential decisions in support are being made.\n\nMoving from a successful pilot to full https://t.co/lyWilLAOZt",hashtag_entities:$R[1373]={__refs:$R[1374]=[]},cashtag_entities:$R[1375]={__refs:$R[1376]=[]},smarttags:$R[1377]={__refs:$R[1378]=[]},created_at_ms:1779294054000},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:note_tweet":$R[1379]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:note_tweet",__typename:"NoteTweetData",is_expandable:!0,note_tweet_results:$R[1380]={__ref:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMDU3MTM0NDgxNTM5MDQ3NDI0"}},Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMDU3MTM0NDgxNTM5MDQ3NDI0:$R[1381]={__id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMDU3MTM0NDgxNTM5MDQ3NDI0",__typename:"NoteTweetResults",result:$R[1382]={__ref:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ="},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMDU3MTM0NDgxNTM5MDQ3NDI0"},"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ=":$R[1383]={__id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ=",__typename:"NoteTweet",text:"Most customer service teams are experimenting with AI. Very few are transforming because of it.\n\nThe gap between those two things is larger than it looks; and right now, it's where the most consequential decisions in support are being made.\n\nMoving from a successful pilot to full production is where most teams struggle, so on May 27 we're hosting a session for the people doing exactly this work.\n\nJoin Declan Ivory, Forrester guest speaker Max Ball, and AppFolio's Guneet Singh, XMP for a webinar that will cover:\n\n➤ Why AI agents are changing the economics of support delivery, not just the speed\n➤ What's actually shifted in AI reliability, scale, and quality over the last 18 months\n➤ Why the jump from pilot to production is harder than most teams expect\n➤ How leading teams sequence for ROI without trading away customer experience\n➤ What moving from experiments to production at scale actually looks like\n\nWe'll also walk through how AppFolio took their AI resolution rate from 17% to 73%, while holding a CX score of 93%. That kind of result doesn't happen by accident.\n\nRegister at the link in the replies.",entity_set:$R[1384]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ=:entity_set":$R[1385]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTcxMzQ0ODE1MzkwNDc0MjQ=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[1386]={__refs:$R[1387]=[]},symbols:$R[1388]={__refs:$R[1389]=[]},smarttags:$R[1390]={__refs:$R[1391]=[]},urls:$R[1392]={__refs:$R[1393]=[]},user_mentions:$R[1394]={__refs:$R[1395]=[]}},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:grok_translated_post_with_availability":$R[1396]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:grok_translated_post_with_availability",__typename:"ApiGrokTranslateResponse",is_available:!1,data:null},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:edit_control":$R[1397]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:edit_control",__typename:"EditControlInitial",edit_tweet_ids:$R[1398]=["2057134481664778581"]},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:quick_promote_eligibility":$R[1399]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:quick_promote_eligibility",__typename:"TweetQuickPromoteEligibilityResponse",eligibility:"IneligibleUserUnauthorized"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:views":$R[1400]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1NzEzNDQ4MTY2NDc3ODU4MQ==:views",__typename:"ViewCountInfo",count:"798"},"urt:server:TimelineTimelineEntry:tweet-2056782888733925808":$R[1401]={__id:"urt:server:TimelineTimelineEntry:tweet-2056782888733925808",__typename:"TimelineTimelineEntry",entry_id:"tweet-2056782888733925808",sort_index:"2074181949835968502",content:$R[1402]={__ref:"client:urt:server:TimelineTimelineEntry:tweet-2056782888733925808:content"}},"client:urt:server:TimelineTimelineEntry:tweet-2056782888733925808:content":$R[1403]={__id:"client:urt:server:TimelineTime