 our 2x productivity goal 3 months early.\n\nJoin us on May 19 for a live session where Fin CTO @darraghcurran, Principal Engineers @brian_scanlan  and Kesha Mykhailov, and special guest @clairevo  break down how Fin’s ~500-person R&D org:\n\n• Shifted to agent-first engineering\n• Got 95% of PRs running through Claude Code\n• Cut defects by 55%\n• Shipped 2x more product changes at nearly half the cycle time\n\nYou'll hear about the messy middle nobody talks about – uneven adoption, code quality dips, the human bottlenecks that mattered more than the technical ones, and what they'd do differently.\n\nRegister at the link in the replies.",entity_set:$R[1616]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set":$R[1617]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[1618]={__refs:$R[1619]=[]},symbols:$R[1620]={__refs:$R[1621]=[]},smarttags:$R[1622]={__refs:$R[1623]=[]},urls:$R[1624]={__refs:$R[1625]=[]},user_mentions:$R[1626]={__refs:$R[1627]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:0","client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:1","client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:2"]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:0":$R[1628]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:0",__typename:"ApiMentionEntity",indices:$R[1629]=[183,197],is_unmentioned:null,screen_name:"darraghcurran"},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:1":$R[1630]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:1",__typename:"ApiMentionEntity",indices:$R[1631]=[219,233],is_unmentioned:null,screen_name:"brian_scanlan"},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTUzNDgyMjMwMzI4NDgzODQ=:entity_set:user_mentions:2":$R[