urchase to support, all in a single conversation. Fin answers questions as customers shop, recommends the right products, guides them to checkout, and continues supporting them after the purchase.\n\nOne Agent, every stage.\n\nConnect your Shopify store in minutes with full knowledge of your catalog, pricing, and inventory. No complex setup required.\n\nPowered by Fin Apex 1.0 and a retrieval engine purpose-built for ecommerce, Fin delivers higher quality experiences across every interaction. Shopify merchants are already seeing higher conversion rates and increased average order value.\n\nWatch Brian and Robert (and Fin) go from discovery to cart to support, all in a single conversation.\n\nLearn more at the link in the replies.",entity_set:$R[2062]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM5MDY4MDc3MjMwNjk0NDA=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM5MDY4MDc3MjMwNjk0NDA="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM5MDY4MDc3MjMwNjk0NDA=:entity_set":$R[2063]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM5MDY4MDc3MjMwNjk0NDA=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[2064]={__refs:$R[2065]=[]},symbols:$R[2066]={__refs:$R[2067]=[]},smarttags:$R[2068]={__refs:$R[2069]=[]},urls:$R[2070]={__refs:$R[2071]=[]},user_mentions:$R[2072]={__refs:$R[2073]=[]}},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:grok_translated_post_with_availability":$R[2074]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:grok_translated_post_with_availability",__typename:"ApiGrokTranslateResponse",is_available:!1,data:null},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:edit_control":$R[2075]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:edit_control",__typename:"EditControlInitial",edit_tweet_ids:$R[2076]=["2053906807832092747"]},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:quick_promote_eligibility":$R[2077]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:quick_promote_eligibility",__typename:"TweetQuickPromoteEligibilityResponse",eligibility:"IneligibleUserUnauthorized"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzkwNjgwNzgzMjA5Mjc0Nw==:views"